# partial-concepts-name-collision sibling — a REAL library literally named "Pol Concepts"
library "Pol Concepts".

// REFACTOR:grounded (#320, plan585): anchored age exercises an ordinary scalar alias without the retired live-age lowering.
parameter "Measurement Period":
- param type is Period.

concept "Sibling Concept":
- shape is Scalar.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is age at start of "Measurement Period" at least 18 years.
